│ Issue Title: feat(agent-team): copy the permission rules when creating agent team members                                                       │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ Description:                                                                                                                                    │
│ **Background**                                                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ Within the agent service (`agentscope.app`), an agent can create team members via the `AgentCreate` tool. However, the sub-agent's permission   │
│ context is currently empty by default. It should inherit the permission rules from the team leader to avoid redundant user confirmations.       │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ **Changes**                                                                                                                                     │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ - When creating a sub-agent via `AgentCreate`, copy the permission rules from the team leader and apply it to the newly created sub-agent.      │
│ - A possible approach: set `is_state_injected=True` in the `AgentCreate` tool so that it has access to the leader's state, then copy the        │
│ permission rules from it.                                                                                                                       │
